flowchart TB
    Cases["B01–B16 固定合成案例<br/>Versioned synthetic catalog"] --> Plan["固定模型／案例／輪次／摘要與預算<br/>Bound plan, versions and shared budget"]
    Plan --> Initial["初始 INCOMPLETE／登記與握手<br/>Supervisor registration before worker"]
    Initial --> Config["驗證供應商設定與工具<br/>Validate adapter configuration"]
    Config --> Reserve["I/O 前保存呼叫 ID／摘要／詞元預留<br/>Persist reservation before network I/O"]
    Reserve --> Request["同案同輪相同盲測內容／循序呼叫<br/>Identical opaque requests; sequential calls"]
    Request --> Adapter["mock／Gemini／Bedrock／LM Studio<br/>GLM 真實連線暫停 / GLM live paused"]
    Adapter -->|"LM Studio"| Local["LM Studio 先查模型清單，再推論<br/>Exact model discovery before chat"]
    Adapter -->|"其他 / Others"| Valid
    Local --> Valid{"正常結束／嚴格 JSON、引用與行號？<br/>Valid completion and semantic evidence?"}
    Valid -->|"是 / Yes"| Success["記錄有效回答／摘要／回報用量<br/>Valid review and reported usage"]
    Valid -->|"否 / No"| Failure["失敗留在分母／不重試<br/>Errors remain in denominators; no retries"]
    Config -->|"設定錯誤／不呼叫<br/>Configuration failure / no call"| Failure
    Success --> Next{"還有計畫呼叫？<br/>More planned calls?"}
    Failure --> Next
    Next -->|"是／仍受總額限制<br/>Yes / shared caps"| Config
    Next -->|"否 / No"| Score["本機 oracle 評分／誤報漏報與分歧<br/>Reference metrics and disagreement"]
    Oracle["標準答案不送給模型<br/>Oracle stays local"] --> Score
    Score --> Cleanup["清理程序群組／目錄，再驗證帳目<br/>Cleanup and final evidence validation"]
    Initial -->|"取消／逾時 / Cancel or timeout"| Cleanup
    Cleanup --> Report["COMPLETE 或 INCOMPLETE／僅供參考<br/>Execution status, never a security pass"]
    Report --> Compare["相容且平衡批次才可彙整<br/>Revalidate compatible balanced batches"]
    Report --> Notes["綁定報告的未簽章人工註記<br/>Unsigned notes; identity unverified"]
